{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "814df39869b81e7c271d06cc1c1960cfd811e31fc5c52dc52e4700eac2071895", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。紬には\nウサギの衣装で撮影すると、事前に伝えていたが……）", "zh": "（事先已经告诉过紬，要穿兔子的服装进行拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6c434caeff8291c87f6d5535195925359fc291abb274889233532ca88faf969c", "ja": "{$P$}、どういうことですか。\n私を……おちょくっているのですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，这是怎么回事？\n你是在……戏弄我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1002_p", "source_sha256": "de3e2f74f45142bf2c019f320f662fc33c774ce2c39621d9ec5d8feb5fa9bfaf", "ja": "えっ？　な、何がだ？", "zh": "诶？什、什么怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "831b7a4ffa31485b6be20cdd404eba466cf961acaf861eaec6bcd50d9d34444c", "ja": "ですから、本日の撮影に共演者がいるとは初耳です！", "zh": "所以说，我还是第一次听说今天的拍摄有搭档演员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5d2c9c47a5bef9418c7d0bf54535f92d2ed09533e4cc498bfb70c823fbdee3ac", "ja": "初耳……。そ、そうか。\n伝えたと思ったんだけど、すまない。", "zh": "第一次听说……这、这样啊。\n我还以为已经告诉你了，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dd99a511d874e0eb22db4e0c0296c49ce32e7cbf166ab755c81b4c6bef93fdd6", "ja": "大切なことは、きちんと教えていただかないと\n困ります。すぐにご挨拶に行かないと……。", "zh": "要紧的事情，您要是不好好告诉我的话\n我会很困扰的。得立刻去打个招呼才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19f5f019911ad6f64d64484fed8bce2836cac9aaa5dccc791fd0944e27762962", "ja": "すみませんが、ミミさんとユキさんのところへ、\n案内していただけますか？", "zh": "不好意思，可以带我去米米小姐和小雪小姐那边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ef52d799410c6b4222116c778fc6546f1ad1f735555891d17207b130d5c57ba3", "ja": "あ、ああ、わかった。案内するよ……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，知道了。我带你过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "54a79244c184c38bdf73185bf72a7b420182cc1f5305ac2c1354fc8f1f855a02", "ja": "あの、{$P$}？\nこっちはスタジオですが……まさか、迷ったのですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}？\n这里是摄影棚……难道说，您迷路了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e94fe80f4375f9ecab3d66d2e945bb3a5410b90320477d54d4435464b97ce371", "ja": "いや、ここで合ってるよ。\nほら。スタジオの奥のケージに……。", "zh": "不，就是这里没错。\n你看。演播室里面的笼子里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2ee13e1ce77643a7594cee499547757d352bb83eb6da48abb844beaec74dddb7", "ja": "奥……。あら？　ニ匹のウサギがいますね。\nお名前は『ミミ』と……『ユキ』？　えっ？", "zh": "里面……哎呀？有两只兔子呢。\n名字是“咪咪”和……“由贵”？诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a326e7b2a1321848513c4937f3495c2af2e2b551a6d2521aa286641f42cd1c85", "ja": "そう。茶色のウサギが『ミミ』で、白いウサギが\n『ユキ』。今日の撮影で共演するウサギたちだ。", "zh": "对。棕色的兔子叫『Mimi』，白色的兔子叫\n『Yuki』。它们是今天拍摄时要一起出演的兔子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7f68294124f9fa5fe1e9184b033e13938df8e655eec7501e26508aeb4e059159", "ja": "で、では、スタッフさんたちが話していた\n共演者というのは……。", "zh": "那、那么，工作人员之前说的共演者就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7643cb033a43e5dbf6512449b00163ffb134bccc690f878ffd9cf32a3e88bc71", "ja": "多分、このウサギのことだろうな。\nちなみに、なんて話してたんだ？", "zh": "大概是指这只兔子吧。\n顺便问一下，他们是怎么说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6341633de6cc93ad6f38f561e7dad8fe40dc2ab5922756415a6f7d768e3770d2", "ja": "……ミミちゃんは、ふわふわしていてかわいくて、\nユキちゃんは色白で美人な方と、おっしゃっていて。", "zh": "……说咪咪毛茸茸的，很可爱，还说小雪肤色白皙，是位美人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "16940206e6ecc70940ac7bb0c9b6182c2b8fd78611c994875edf00451424ddcf", "ja": "ええ。お聞きしていたとおりの愛らしさで……。\nううっ。私はなんて間違いを……！", "zh": "嗯，确实如您所说，真是可爱……  \n呜呜，我到底犯了多大的错啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1016_p", "source_sha256": "89bd2d439708d8332c3a3bef74ad04249738c7eb416a2eadad4996e443c5c942", "ja": "ま、まあまあ！　紬に紹介しようと思ってたから\nちょうどよかったよ。", "zh": "嗯、好啦好啦！我正想着要介绍给紬认识呢，\n真是正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2e57213e705bf4488b903303b18e77c9be60a85fa6e13b0bd23af491e6a162a4", "ja": "エサをあげてもいいそうだから、\nウサギたちと仲良くなってみないか？", "zh": "听说可以喂食，要不要试着和兔子们成为朋友？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "58596c04c3c920d3aec97490bfa9f9129752fbfd995f5e9829096bf72fac1936", "ja": "エサを……！　まあ、そこまで言うなら……。\nこれも撮影のために必要なことですから、ふふっ。", "zh": "可以喂食……！既然你都这么说了……。\n这也是拍摄所必需的事情，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0513_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3f48b286f4a09a398e048ea77ca093095b3ecb9383ebe6cb124d02a683faa54b", "ja": "（その後、ウサギたちと無邪気に遊ぶ紬の写真は\nファンの間でも好評だった！）", "zh": "（之后，紬和兔子们天真无邪地玩耍的照片，受到了粉丝们的好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
